BT /F1 10.5 Tf 50 790 Td 14.5 TL (ILLUSTRATIVE TEXT FOR TESTING - NOT AN OFFICIAL RWANDA FDA DOCUMENT) Tj T* () Tj T* (GUIDELINES ON LABELLING OF REGULATED PRODUCTS) Tj T* (Version 2026-01) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Scope) Tj T* (These guidelines apply to the labels of all products registered by Rwanda FDA: human and) Tj T* (veterinary medicines, food products, cosmetics and medical devices. The label submitted with) Tj T* (an application must be the label that will be used on the market.) Tj T* () Tj T* (2. Product identification) Tj T* (The label must state the brand name of the product. For medicines, it must also state the) Tj T* (name of the active ingredient \(INN\), the strength and the pharmaceutical form, for example) Tj T* ("Paracetamol 500 mg tablets".) Tj T* () Tj T* (3. Storage conditions) Tj T* (The label must state the storage conditions, including a specific temperature or temperature) Tj T* (range, for example "Store below 30°C" or "Store between 2°C and 8°C". General statements) Tj T* (such as "store in a cool, dry place" or "store properly" are not acceptable on their own.) Tj T* (The storage conditions on the label must be the same as the storage conditions declared in) Tj T* (the application.) Tj T* () Tj T* (4. Expiry date) Tj T* (The label must show the expiry date, or the format in which it will be printed, preceded by) Tj T* ("EXP", for example "EXP: MM/YYYY". The batch number must also be shown, preceded by "Batch") Tj T* (or "Lot".) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. Manufacturer) Tj T* (The label must state the name and the full address of the manufacturer, including the) Tj T* (country.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. Ingredients) Tj T* (Food products and cosmetics must list all ingredients on the label. Food products list) Tj T* (ingredients in descending order of weight and highlight allergens such as milk, soy, wheat) Tj T* (\(gluten\), eggs, peanuts and tree nuts. Cosmetics list ingredients using INCI names.) Tj T* () Tj T* (7. Language) Tj T* (Labels must be in English, French or Kinyarwanda. Additional languages may be added.) Tj T* ET
endstream
